source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
Settings in config.toml (never secrets). Keys: default-profile.

Usage: hn config [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list  Show all settings
  get   Show one setting
  set   Change a setting
  path  Print where config.toml lives

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn config
  hn config set default-profile work
  hn config path
